msgstr[0] "수제 레이저 권총"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This laser pistol was based on the V29 laser pistol designed in the mid-21st"
" century.  While little more than duct tape and electronics, it runs on a "
"standard UPS."
msgstr ""

