msgid ""
"Use key code or symbol input on SDL.  Symbol is recommended for non-qwerty "
"layouts since currently the default keybindings for key code mode only "
"supports qwerty.  Key code is currently WIP and bypasses IMEs, caps lock, "
"and num lock."
