msgid ""
"Your pale skin is sweating, your heart is beating fast, and you feel "
"restless.  Maybe you lost too much blood?"
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid ""
"You're unsettlingly white, but your fingertips are bluish.  You are agitated"
" and your heart is racing.  Your blood loss must be serious."
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp
msgid ""
"You are pale as a ghost, dripping wet from the sweat, and sluggish - despite"
" your heart racing like a train.  You are on the brink of collapse from the "
"effects of blood loss."
msgstr ""

